    company:
    contract: Islands of Light / Protected
    text: "SABLE / community grid engineer: Complete your alliance\u2019s final operation against the distributed fallback system. The sender asks you to keep the names attached to the evidence; anonymous totals have concealed people before."
  - id: shelter-ending-careful/1
    title: Islands of Light / Protected / Custody note
    company:
    contract: Islands of Light / Protected
    text: 'Archive custody, Islands of Light / Protected: Independent districts keep their own power and identity ledgers. The Directorate loses its monopoly on continuity. Your allies protected the witnesses before acting; some records escaped, but their people did not disappear. A second copy carries a hand-written objection to the official disposition.'
