    contract: Islands of Light / Protected
    text: 'Personal note filed under shelter-ending-careful: Independent districts keep their own power and identity ledgers. The Directorate loses its monopoly on continuity. Your allies protected the witnesses before acting; some records escaped, but their people did not disappear. Someone has crossed out the word inevitable. No replacement was supplied.'
